WEBVTT

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:53.380
Keough!

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:11.670
Iruga!

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:25.780
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:29.750
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:32.250
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:36.760
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:42.560
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:46.500
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:54.610
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:54.610 --> 00:02:01.910
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:07.460
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:14.590
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:20.070
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:22.500
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:29.440
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.710
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.780
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.290
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:42.820
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:48.630
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:51.530
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:04.910
We achieved what we set out to do.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.850
Let's return to Prontera.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:08.980
I'm so happy!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.120
Big Brother Iruga!

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.620
Hey, hey, hey you!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:16.320
Just because you partied for him,

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:19.330
doesn't mean you can lead him on like that.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.360
Stay away from Iruga!

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.230
What do you mean?

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:25.830
You're the one that needs to stay away from my Big Brother Iruga!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.900
You call him Big Brother, but you're not his sister.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:32.000
You're such a pain!
Let's go, Iruga.

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.980
I'm not letting him!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.380
I said, let's go!

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.710
No, he's not!

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:39.880
We're going!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.780
No, you're not!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.190
--He's going with me!
--No, he's not!

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:47.260
--He is, I said!
--You're annoying, he's coming with me!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:50.350
Grrr... Hey, you!

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.430
What's your story?

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:56.760
Huh?

00:03:56.760 --> 00:04:00.340
You've traveled with her.
Didn't anything happen?

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:03.310
Big Brother Iruga!

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:09.310
Uh... no... if you're asking if we're lovers...

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.370
Absolutely nothing.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:15.580
They say that friendship between men and women is close yet far.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.620
Why not just tie the knot?

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.150
Tie the knot?

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.490
Not a chance.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:25.980
They say the long road is often the shortest route.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.500
Instead of risking the dangers of the short route,

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:34.500
why not take the safe, long road?

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.940
That may well be the fastest way to reach your goal.

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:40.710
<i>Friendship between men and women?</i>

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.440
<i>Tie the knot?</i>

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.680
<i>The dangers?</i>

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:50.080
<i>Hurry up and reach... my goal?</i>

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:53.090
Yay! Rabbit ears, rabbit ears!

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:54.860
Rabbit ears, rabbit ears!

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:56.020
So cute!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.010
Hmph!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:03.400
Look! My Iruga has cat ears!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.800
Rabbit ears are cuter!

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.140
Grrr... Cat ears are!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.310
Rabbit ears!

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:12.310
Cat ears!

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.340
Rabbit ears!

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:14.310
Cat ears!

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:16.310
Stop, stop it, you two!

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.970
Don't play with my Big Brother Iruga!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:26.020
You're so cute, Big Brother Iruga!

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:27.720
What's that?

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.990
It's a clown's nose!

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.830
I knew that!

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:42.170
Aww! Big Brother Iruga!

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:46.240
Grrr! Let go!

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.710
No!

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:48.710
Let go!

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:51.010
--Let go!
--I won't let-

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:53.000
I will <i>not</i> let go!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:02.290
In any case, let us go to Prontera.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.950
But, before we go...

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.300
Fortune telling!

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.300
Does that work?

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.510
It's not a question of whether it works or not.

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:22.410
Fortune telling is a forecast of things to come.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:25.810
If it says that we'll encounter calamity on the road we travel,

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:29.250
then we take another road.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:32.350
That way we avoid calamity, right?

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.660
In other words, it's a glimpse into the future.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:39.060
A guide to the right path.
That's what fortune telling is.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.600
What's this? We can't go, we can't go.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.200
We have to cancel our trip.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:49.070
It's best that you guys not go to Prontera.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:51.910
We'll just go on our own... Iruga?

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:55.910
If it's a bad sign then you'll come with us, won't you Big Brother Iruga?

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.950
No! If Iruga goes, so must I.

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:03.480
He can't be without me.
Right, Iruga?

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.550
What's that supposed to mean?

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:08.110
It's a deep meaning.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:10.530
Let's go, Big Brother Iruga.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.930
I said you're leading my Iruga on too much!

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:15.260
Let's go! Let's go!

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:18.100
So, we're going together with them?

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.470
To travel is to go with others.

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:25.440
It's also said that life is full of vexations.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:27.380
<i>Go with others...</i>

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.970
<i>Full of vexations...</i>

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.820
Let's go, Poi-Poi

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:34.980
Poring!

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:39.990
Just as I thought...

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:45.320
I'm thinking too much...

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:15.790
Walking together like this is just like old times, isn't it?

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.300
Yuufa...

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.830
Here.

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:28.570
Eat. You'll feel better.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.340
Huh?

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:29.960
Here.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.810
Here, here, here, here!

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:38.640
Are you all right?

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:53.990
Are you all right?
Maybe that was too much.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.660
Pull yourself together.

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.600
Not here...

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:09.940
Okay, okay...

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:21.020
Where's Yuufa?

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:23.190
Hey, what about Iruga?

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:25.290
Iruga's not here!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:26.930
They couldn't have!

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.700
Big Brother Iruga!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.130
Yuufa...

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.630
Ah...

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:36.840
Where's Yuufa?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:41.540
She's getting some water.

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:43.640
Is that all?

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:52.140
What's wrong, Iruga?

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:55.660
The birds...

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.650
...are gone too.

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:00.990
Yuufa!

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:20.340
Aqua Benedicta!

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:20.330
Yuufa!

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.010
Iruga!

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.030
Yuufa!

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:49.300
What... is that?

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.360
The Goat Ghost!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.310
Baphomet.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.370
Baphomet?

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.660
Oh no!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.340
Are you all right?

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:40.010
Frost Di-

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.360
Frost...

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:58.360
Diver!

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:01.970
It worked!

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.330
Double Strafing!

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:36.670
Yes! I got him! Iruga!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.190
Is that all you got?

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:52.680
I-It spoke!

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:18.650
Heal!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:35.330
Heal! Heal! Heal!

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.510
We're no match!

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.500
Poring!

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.670
Over here!

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:15.640
Catch me if you can!

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:22.310
Over here!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.340
Got him!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:04.630
It's no use! If you resist, it'll only dig in!

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.630
No way!

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:27.980
Run!

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:59.050
Big Brother Iruga!

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:01.020
Lighting...

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.950
Bolt!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:15.950
Iruga!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:30.640
Takius-<i>sa-</i>

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.450
No... No...

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.320
No!

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.000
Yuufa!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:04.080
Somebody... help...

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.610
Big Brother Keough!

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:08.150
Let me go...

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:09.850
It hurts...

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:11.940
Sis!

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:19.230
No! You mustn't go!

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:23.060
I can still fight!

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:28.600
No! Stay away! Don't come any closer!

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:33.370
No, Iruga! You'll get killed!
I won't let you go!

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:35.470
Iruga?

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:38.470
You're...

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:53.830
That was you...

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.500
What about your accomplice?
I'm certain that...

00:18:56.500 --> 00:19:01.200
You called him Keough!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.930
Keough?

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:09.930
I don't care. I'm tired of playing.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:23.550
What are you hesitating for?

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:28.820
Getting someone like him... is easy.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:30.820
What a waste of time!

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:35.700
He would... never do that.

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:40.030
Don't compare me to your master!

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:51.040
But, you...

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:54.710
You have something he doesn't.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.090
My money... my money.

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:02.650
I can't find my money!

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.670
Iruga...

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:26.850
That was the name of that masked man, right?

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:28.820
The one Baphomet said...

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:31.020
...Keough.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.250
Huh?

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:34.760
Ouch...

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:37.020
What did you just say?

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.490
Huh?

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:42.430
That hurts! I said that hurts, Yuufa!

00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:46.030
What? That masked man from the other day!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:49.700
Our brother... Is our brother alive?

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way to</i> <i>regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:33.470
<i>This is Glaris.</i>

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:36.210
<i>Yuufa is worried about Keough.</i>

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:38.680
<i>Can she find him through the fog?</i>

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:42.820
<i>Next time:</i> <i>"I Won't Let Anyone Get in My Way."</i>

00:23:42.820 --> 00:23:45.340
<i>Until we meet again...</i>
